 85	 * pooled error text would be looser than it reads — under a oneOf, Ajv
 86	 * reports every branch's complaints, and a fragment can match a branch the
 87	 * fixture was never aimed at. The map is also the inventory: a fixture
 88	 * without an entry, or an entry whose fixture is gone, fails the suite.
